### 1. Registrar una nueva cuenta
POST http://localhost:5028/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gustavo@allentech.com",
  "password": "SuperPassword123!"
}

### 2. Iniciar sesión y generar el JWT
POST http://localhost:5028/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gustavo@allentech.com",
  "password": "SuperPassword123!"
}